  "description": "A reusable xUnit conformance suite for OrionLedger IApiKeyStore implementations. Derive from ApiKeyStoreConformanceTests, supply a store factory, and inherit a battery of contract tests covering add, lookup by hash and id, update, revoke, rotation timestamps, last-used tracking (including a concurrent-increment check), scope round-trips, and lookup by subject. Run it against any custom store to confirm it honours the IApiKeyStore contract.",
